# Build context hygiene for the gateway image (docker build -t zintus .).
#
# CRITICAL: this must NOT exclude packages/tokzen/src, packages/tokzen/scripts,
# packages/tokzen/tsup.config.ts, or the tsconfig*.json files — they are needed
# to BUILD tokzen's ./dist inside the image. Excluding the *outputs* below is
# safe ONLY because the Dockerfile runs `bun run --filter tokzen build` after
# `bun install` to regenerate them. Before this file existed, the absence of a
# .dockerignore let the host's gitignored packages/tokzen/dist leak into the
# image via `COPY packages ./packages`, masking a broken in-image build — the
# false pass we are fixing.

# Dependencies — reinstalled in-image by `bun install --frozen-lockfile`.
# (Host node_modules carry platform-specific binaries + symlinks; never copy.)
**/node_modules

# Build artifacts — rebuilt in-image (tokzen/dist via tsup; everything else is
# either rebuilt or unused at runtime). Keeping these out forces a clean build.
**/dist
**/.next
**/.expo
**/.turbo
**/out
**/target
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Tree-sitter grammar WASM is regenerated by tokzen's postinstall during
# `bun install`; the host copies (if any) should not be baked in.
packages/tokzen/grammars/*.wasm

# VCS, CI, and local tooling/scratch.
.git
.gitignore
.github
.claude
.wrangler

# Secrets / local env — must never be baked into a published image.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.dev.vars

# Coverage + test scratch dirs.
coverage
.tokzen-test
.tokzen-ci

# Tests are not needed at runtime and are not part of tokzen's build entry.
**/*.test.ts
**/tests

# Misc noise.
*.log
.DS_Store
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
README*.md
docs
